{
  // MODE-DIVERGENCE REGISTRY - tooling only, NOT built into dist/overlay.json
  //
  // WHY THIS FILE EXISTS
  // tarkov.dev derives one game mode's numbers from the other for some tasks,
  // and the direction it mirrors can flip. Overrides that only pin the mode
  // that happens to be broken today silently become both redundant AND
  // insufficient when the mirror reverses - which is exactly what happened to
  // the PvE experience overrides (see git history for src/overrides/modes/pve).
  //
  // This registry records the TRUE value for BOTH modes so a flip in either
  // direction is detectable. `npm run check-overrides` compares the effective
  // merged value per mode against these entries and reports which overrides are
  // currently load-bearing versus currently redundant. Redundant entries are
  // reported as intentional guards - never as "delete this".
  //
  // Values recorded here are never deleted when upstream agrees. That deletion
  // policy is what allowed the regression to go unnoticed.
  //
  // SOURCES OF TRUTH
  //   pve      -> `in-game`: PvE values verified in-game on the PvE profile
  //               (read off the quest screens). PvE is the mode we verify
  //               directly, so it is treated as authoritative here.
  //   regular  -> `wiki`: the EFT wiki documents PvP/regular values. Regular is
  //               not verified in-game here, so the wiki is the best witness.
  //
  // STATUS
  //   divergent      - the two modes genuinely differ in-game; both values pinned
  //   converged      - modes currently share one value; kept as history so a
  //                    future divergence is detectable
  //   mode-exclusive - task only exists in one mode; no cross-mode comparison

  // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  // DIVERGENT - upstream currently mirrors the PvE value into regular, so
  // regular-mode consumers get PvE experience. Regular overrides are required.
  // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

